ORIGINAL PROJECT
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pastel-macOS
  Author:   EEliberto
  Source:   https://github.com/EEliberto/Pastel-macOS
  License:  Apache License, Version 2.0
            http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

This fork adapts Pastel-macOS to run on macOS 15 (Sequoia). The only
functional change is lowering the deployment target from macOS 26 to macOS 15
and replacing the macOS 26 "Liquid Glass" UI with native macOS 15 SwiftUI
containers/controls. All application logic (StoreServices login, IPA download,
version aggregation) is preserved exactly as in the original.
Fork maintained/modified on 2026-09-14 by VincentGan260 (https://github.com/VincentGan260/Pastel-macOS15).


